//! PARTIAL RESTART CHECKPOINT — not declared by synthesis/mod.rs or any producer.
//!
//! Proposed native MDX component operation, not compiled or qualified. Before activation:
//! add exact component/attribute/declared-option inputs to documentary::Data; add the
//! DocumentarySource::Component arm, component boundary output and authored constructor;
//! wire producer, shared replay, assertion policy/rendering and canonical source hash;
//! resolve the budget API in option(); retain source/effective ambiguity; add the actual
